00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:05.972 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ici, on a plusieurs rangs

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:07.207 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de maraîcher. On n'est pas

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:08.442 size:53% position:73% line:53%
