00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.456 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais les choses sont en train

00:00:54.321 --> 00:00:57.657 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de changer.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:58.892 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Enfin, là, c'est concret et

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:00.160 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on peut vous faire visiter notre

00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:01.361 size:53% position:73% line:53%
infrastructure.

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:02.562 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La productrice d'oies Fernande

00:01:00.494 --> 00:01:03.797 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ouellet, travaille depuis plus

00:01:01.695 --> 00:01:05.032 size:53% position:73% line:53%
