00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:06.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le Petit Abattoir.

00:01:04.131 --> 00:01:07.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
FERNANDE OUELLET, chargée

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.502 size:53% position:73% line:53%
