00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:45.799 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ANDRÉ LAMONTAGNE, ministre

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:47.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'Agriculture du Québec

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:48.802 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- D'abord, ce qui est important,

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:50.337 size:53% position:73% line:53%
