00:02:57.811 --> 00:03:01.948 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est ça qui peut être complexe.

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:03.683 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On regarde peut-être pour

00:03:00.514 --> 00:03:05.018 size:53% position:73% line:53%
faire une table champêtre

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:06.386 size:53% position:73% line:53%
éventuellement.

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:07.754 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Katie Guillemette, elle,

00:03:05.352 --> 00:03:09.122 size:53% position:73% line:53%
planifie la diversification

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:10.590 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de son élevage.

00:03:08.088 --> 00:03:12.058 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ça change vraiment tout.

00:03:09.456 --> 00:03:13.593 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Si c'était pas du Petit

00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:15.128 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Abattoir, mon plan d'affaires,

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:16.630 size:53% position:73% line:53%
change complètement. Je ne peux

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:18.164 size:53% position:73% line:53%
