00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:20.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chose de différent.

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:22.235 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il reste à espérer que

00:03:19.833 --> 00:03:23.570 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la grippe aviaire, qui prend

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:24.938 size:53% position:73% line:53%
